at":"2026-03-19T10:33:05Z"},{"id":3974805612,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7s6rhs","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","login":"StarryWorm","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm"},"body":"LGTM!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-3974805612","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-19T12:35:43Z"},{"id":3975185342,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7s8IO-","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?u=7e327c81e8a9552ea98ca69adcccac4a50657dd9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","login":"DeeJayLSP","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-3975185342","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-19T13:37:16Z"},{"id":3975847850,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7s-p-q","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","login":"StarryWorm","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm"},"body":"Turns out the CI error wasn't unrelated, unlike I assumed for my earlier positive review.\n\nIn rewriting `ClassDB::get_method_list()` and `ClassDB::get_method_list_with_compatibility()` to use the new `gdtype->get_method_map()` you got rid of the virtual methods from the \"return\" `List<MethodInfo> *p_methods`. \n\nHighlighted the two erroneous removals in comments and potential fixes.\nOtherwise, a `ClassDB::get_virtual_methods_with_compatibility()` must be added and every caller site of both methods must have the associated virtual method added.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-3975847850","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-19T15:30:54Z"},{"id":3976459404,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7tA_SM","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","login":"StarryWorm","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm"},"body":"The two checks for `type->disabled` will not behave in this PR the same way as they used to due to using `gdtype->get_method_map(p_no_inheritance)` instead of the old looping through every single type. \n\nAssuming `p_no_inheritance == false`, otherwise it's not relevant\nBefore: type -> check disabled -> add methods if not -> supertype replaces type -> loop\nAfter: type -> check disabled -> add all methods of self and all supertypes\n\nThis means we go from only including methods for type and all non-disabled supertypes to including methods for type and all supertypes if type is not disabled. \n\nThis can be handled:\nA. By reintroducing the loops and using `gdtype->get_method_map(true)`\nB. By changing the way method maps are handled on `GDType` to take into account disabled types when using `get_method_map(false)`","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-3976459404","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-19T16:44:59Z"},{"id":3976870377,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7tCjnp","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-3976870377","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-19T17:46:04Z"},{"id":3988235638,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7tt6V2","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?u=7e327c81e8a9552ea98ca69adcccac4a50657dd9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","login":"DeeJayLSP","ty