s":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"Can't pretend I'm fully versed in this part of the engine (especially in 4.x) but from a look through, the aims of moving to `GDType` seem worthwhile.\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n* Fixes the stability bug after hot-reload with the soft leaks\r\n* Gets rid of the method order difference in debug and release\r\n\r\nThings to note:\r\n* there does seem a performance regression with `AHashMap` - this isn't a blocker imo. This temporary regression will become a net positive once more is moved out of `ClassDB`\r\n* I'm assuming the soft leaks have been checked they don't produce too much memory bloat\r\n* documentation may be affected (where methods were previously badly classified)\r\n\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-4946366450","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-16T14:10:28Z"},{"id":4952995045,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJzi05Q","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"4d902fd3aafc6aafe996970cc19968456763a6c0","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"Very nice!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#pullrequestreview-4952995045","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-17T17:20:58Z"}]